  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 募\ntitle: recruit; solicit\njlpt: 2\ntags: [jlpt-n2, grade-8, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 12\nradical: 力\nradicalNumber: 19\nonyomi: [ボ]\nkunyomi: [つの.る]\ndistractors: [暮, 労, 草]\n---\n\n# 募 — recruit; solicit\n\n**Strokes:** 12 · **Key (radical):** 力 (no. 19) · **JLPT:** N2 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n募 concerns seeking people, applications, or contributions. 募集 ぼしゅう is recruitment or taking applications, and 募金 ぼきん is fundraising. The native verb 募る つのる also describes a feeling growing stronger.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** Picture the 艹-shaped top, 日-shaped center, and spreading lower strokes above 力, as though gathering many people's efforts.\n\nThe canonical indexing radical is 力 at the bottom, not the conspicuous 艹-shaped top.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ボ | on | [募集](../words/募集.md) ぼしゅう - recruitment; taking applications |\n| つの.る | kun | 募る つのる - grow stronger; solicit contributions or participants |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [募集](../words/募集.md) ぼしゅう - recruitment; taking applications\n- 募る つのる - solicit; grow stronger\n- 応募 おうぼ - application; entry\n- 募金 ぼきん - fundraising\n\n## Notes\n\n- The recruiting side 募集する seeks applicants; the applicant 応募する responds. These compounds share 募 but describe different sides of the process.\n- 募る has both intransitive and transitive uses: 不安が募る ふあんがつのる, anxiety grows, versus 参加者を募る さんかしゃをつのる, seek participants. The particle and context distinguish the uses.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-10-21 snapshot. Word pairs: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1180030, 1514800, 1514810, 1514830.\n",
